<template compat="shopify">
{%- comment -%}
  Materia Themes. What a quote card of Testimonial Wall and Testimonial With
  Product holds: the stars (only when a rating is set), the customer's words,
  then the customer's picture, name and the line under the name. An empty
  part is printed hidden, so a value typed in the builder shows at once. The
  name is an h3; the picture sits beside it, so its alt text is empty.
  bs: the testimonial block's settings.
{%- endcomment -%}
{% render 'r7-testimonial-stars', rating: bs.rating %}
<p class="r7t-card__quote" data-r7t-text{% if bs.body == blank %} hidden{% endif %}>{{ bs.body | escape }}</p>
<div class="r7t-card__by" data-r7t-by{% if bs.name == blank and bs.role == blank and bs.avatar == blank %} hidden{% endif %}>
  <span class="r7t-card__avatar" data-r7t-avatar{% if bs.avatar == blank %} hidden{% endif %}>
    {%- if bs.avatar != blank -%}
      {{ bs.avatar | image_url: width: 120 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', decoding: 'async', widths: '40,80,120', sizes: '40px', width: 40, height: 40, alt: '' }}
    {%- endif -%}
  </span>
  <div class="r7t-card__who">
    <h3 class="r7t-card__name" data-r7t-name{% if bs.name == blank %} hidden{% endif %}>{{ bs.name | escape }}</h3>
    <p class="r7t-card__role" data-r7t-role{% if bs.role == blank %} hidden{% endif %}>{{ bs.role | escape }}</p>
  </div>
</div>
</template>
